  "source_caption": "Jack Nicholson and Michelle Pfeiffer starred in Wolf, a 1994 romantic horror film directed by Mike Nichols.\n\nIn the original script, the main character Will Randall was a lawyer. Writers changed his job to publishing because it felt like a fresher approach for the story. Jack Nicholson and co-writer Jim Harrison worked on developing the project for 12 years before it finally made it to the screen. Jim Harrison based the concept on a claim that he experienced \"lunar psychosis\" during a full moon at his Michigan cabin 15 years prior, where he felt hair grow and ripped cabin doors off their hinges.",
